               <text>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">Inactive ingredients</content> Anhydrous citric acid, carboxymethylcellulose, flavors, glycerin,
  <br/>
purified water, sodium benzoate, sorbitol solution, sucralose, xanthan gum.
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260216"/>
            </section>
